{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33348","headline":"幽轩 · 欧阳玭","name":"幽轩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽轩斜映山，空涧复潺潺。\n重叠岩峦趣，遥来窗户间。\n桃花飘岫幌，燕子语松关。\n衣桁侵池翠，阶痕露藓斑。\n临风清瑟奏，对客白云闲。\n眷恋青春色，含毫俯碧湾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳玭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33348.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33348","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}